profile: runtime-mirust.docs-routing.v1
updated_utc: 2026-06-29T23:30:00Z
package_version: 1.0.4
public_base_url: https://Runtime.MiRust.com
purpose: Deep-link map from hot .uai memory to durable /docs report bodies, research bodies, source-memory pages, and the published long-term pointer ledger.
uaix_setup_source: https://uaix.org/en-us/tools/ai-memory-package-wizard/#setup-file-handoff
rules:
  - Hot .uai files carry routing, synthesis, proofs, checksums, and next-step prompts.
  - Durable report bodies live under /docs/reports/ and /docs/research/.
  - .uai/long-term-memory.uai remains pointer-shaped and links to durable bodies instead of duplicating them.
  - Active intake belongs in agent-file-handoff/Content/ and agent-file-handoff/Improvement/ until disposition is recorded.
indexes:
  docs_index: https://Runtime.MiRust.com/docs/index.md
  manifest: https://Runtime.MiRust.com/docs/MANIFEST.md
  reports_index: https://Runtime.MiRust.com/docs/reports/index.md
