## Plain PHP rebuild v1.0.5

The WordPress deployment path is superseded. Runtime.MiRust.com now ships as a root-extractable plain PHP site with `/index.php`, `/inc/site.php`, `/data/pages.json`, `/assets/`, `/docs/`, and `/.uai/`. See `/docs/implementation/runtime-mirust-plain-php-rebuild-v1.0.5.md`.


runtime_mirust_plain_php_v106_continuation:
  updated_utc: 2026-06-30T14:33:29Z
  version: 1.0.6
  summary: Added /site-origin-fix/, /runtime-health/, /source-facts/, /launch-operations/, /healthz, /version.json, stale WordPress route interception, cPanel default-page route handling, and verification scripts.
  public_routes:
    - /site-origin-fix/
    - /runtime-health/
    - /source-facts/
    - /launch-operations/
    - /healthz
    - /version.json
